    "nodos": {
      "da-1": {
        "texto": "It is night and this plaza is dark. I am Lumen. I want the lantern to light up when you decide, and I will show you how. First: press Build; I will point it out with an arrow.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "abre-el-taller"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-1": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Press the Build button: the world has a build mode and a play mode.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-2": {
        "texto": "Good. Now, in Add there is a library: drag a Lantern into the plaza. You will learn to place things.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "pon-un-farolillo"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-2": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Open Add and place a lantern in the plaza.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-3": {
        "texto": "Move it with the coloured arrows (X red, Y green, Z blue) and turn it. If you make a mistake, undo.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "muevelo"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-3": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Move the lantern with the coloured arrows and turn it.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-4": {
        "texto": "Now switch it off: in its card, mark it hidden while playing. You still see it; whoever plays does not.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "apagalo"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-4": {
        "texto": "Carry on: In the lantern's card, mark it so it is not seen while playing.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-5": {
        "texto": "There is a cable already made: open the Cable panel. «When THIS happens, THAT happens». Press Test on the Red button.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "mira-el-cable"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-5": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Open the Cable panel, read the sample cable and press the Red button.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-6": {
        "texto": "Now you do it: in the Cable panel, «+ New cable». You choose when and what.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "tu-primer-cable"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-6": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Create your first cable with «+ New cable».",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-7": {
        "texto": "Swap the button for a zone: the cable fires when someone steps into the circle.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "cuando-zona"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-7": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Swap the button for a zone: «enter this circle».",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-8": {
        "texto": "Now how much: set a few seconds of wait and tick «single use». The server watches: the cable cannot cheat.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "cuanto-espera"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-8": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Set a wait of a few seconds and tick «single use».",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-9": {
        "texto": "One WHEN, many WHATs: add another action to your cable (play a sound, teleport, open a link…).",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "varios-que"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-9": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Add another action to your cable: play a sound, teleport, open a link or advance a mission.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-10": {
        "texto": "Last trick: make your cable start from another piece's signal. That is how escape rooms are born.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "encadena"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-10": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Make a cable start when another piece gives notice (a signal).",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "da-11": {
        "texto": "Final challenge: write a two-step mission with your cable as the second step, and tell me about it.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Okay, let's go.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "dar_mision",
              "mision": "tu-mini-mision"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Not now.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "pista-11": {
        "texto": "Carry on: Write a 2-step mission with your cable as the second step and show it to Lumen.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Here is my mini-mission.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "avanzar_paso",
              "mision": "tu-mini-mision"
            }
          },
          {
            "texto": "Okay.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "final": {
        "texto": "You did it: you are a Builder now. Take the plaza to your own world with your first cable inside.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Thank you, Lumen.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "hola": {
        "texto": "I am Lumen, guardian of the workshop. If you have a mission under way, look at it in the book (J): it shows a single button and moves on by itself when you use it. Talk to me again when you finish it.",
        "opciones": [
          {
            "texto": "Goodbye.",
            "accion": {
              "tipo": "despedir"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
